WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.491
Every morning, the app downloads John Deere's order files by itself.

00:00:04.942 --> 00:00:08.754
Sometimes John Deere asks for a code sent by SMS.

00:00:08.754 --> 00:00:11.322
Then this window opens by itself.

00:00:11.773 --> 00:00:15.778
Type the code from the SMS, and click Submit OTP.

00:00:18.326 --> 00:00:19.802
You have eight minutes.

00:00:19.802 --> 00:00:23.266
If the time runs out, click Sync again for a new code.

00:00:23.717 --> 00:00:28.628
Admins can also start it by hand, with Sync now, in Admin Settings.
